tWhenNotReady: true`. That head has not passed `dev.check`.\n\nThe draft still reports readiness gaps, so it cannot become ready. The code comment that says \"The gates are already green (the final check above); publication goes straight out\" describes the checked head, not the pushed head.\n\nPass the head that passed the final check into `finishNotReady`. Compare it with the re-read head before `publishHead`, on every path. On mismatch, return a refusal and do not push or open the draft. The caller can then rerun the final check.","id":"c3f00b3d4653a7199ea59a2162d299c8ccb5615ba4a3b53de07f05f9302b594e","intervals":[[1428,1428]],"path":"src/ops/dev/cycle.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Check the head before publishing a not-ready draft."}],"head":"faa474a108bc84df4ea0e9b5fe931ddb94484035","head_tree":"2a6378f38614c8b16a7d30447cf71e2ddc2985f6","input_scope":[{"blob":"57aa776a8f9d955b9d958361c02fab90e6ac6d00","intervals":[[1,1687]],"path":"src/ops/dev/cycle.ts"}],"job_id":"e0777413541418180841da4d0b5920f166eb08980652cd30faa910768160e0da:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"57aa776a8f9d955b9d958361c02fab90e6ac6d00","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/dev/cycle.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"57aa776a8f9d955b9d958361c02fab90e6ac6d00","intervals":[[57,62],[69,70],[93,93],[97,97],[226,250],[252,253],[256,259],[268,272],[274,274],[283,285],[292,294],[302,304],[322,335],[444,461],[463,463],[524,530],[546,551],[562,566],[619,624],[785,791],[1165,1177],[1256,1266],[1292,1302],[1315,1315],[1355,1392],[1458,1462],[1464,1468],[1474,1474],[1483,1487],[1490,1490],[1494,1495],[1532,1533],[1659,1664],[1673,1677]],"path":"src/ops/dev/cycle.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"57aa776a8f9d955b9d958361c02fab90e6ac6d0